WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Why do I have a feeling this will break soon?

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.620
I have been expecting you Otto

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.980
Okay Emil come and give me a hand

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.860
Emil is like: GET OFF!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.060
Go and get it!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:53.800
Go and get it!

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.220
Jackpot!

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.820
If you guys haven't subscribed to our channel

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.720
Do us a favor and do it now!

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.660
You won't regret it!

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:12.600
Come on Miikka

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:14.740
You can do this!

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.360
It's all about your spinning Emil

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.500
Let's go!

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.600
Why do I have a feeling this will break soon?

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.240
A bit dangerous!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.120
It is!

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:41.620
In the "Stereotypes 4" video I had a grip like this

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:47.080
So let's see if I can actually play with it

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:54.460
It's better than my normal forehand!

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.100
What a shot!

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:01.400
I like this!

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.780
Well, it worked for a while!

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.600
Fake reverse

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:31.080
What started as a joke

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.580
Actually worked quite well!

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:36.320
For this challenge we need to break the ball a bit

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:41.380
I can't believe it takes this many shots for Otto to break a ball...

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.100
We got a crack

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.240
There we have it!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.240
The crack is getting bigger and bigger!

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.460
It's going over the half way

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.260
Now it might be a bit of a challenge already

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.600
Good training for your reflexes

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:37.080
Now there shouldn't be any normal bounces anymore!

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.220
No, there shouldn't!

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.920
Okay, the final stage of a broken ball

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.480
That's not a ball anymore

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.060
Do you think it's going to work?

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.480
I don't think so

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:05.640
Me neither!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.760
Actually got the serve on!

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:15.040
Okay I think we are done with this challenge

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.960
Leave your ideas for the next challenge episode

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:19.820
in the comments

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.940
And hit subscribe so you don't miss it!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.000
Until next time!

